r7u|n|A person or thing regarded with peculiar favor; one treated with partiality; one preferred above others; especially, one unduly loved, trusted, and enriched with favors by a person of high rank or authority. ; Short curls dangling over the temples; -- fashionable in the reign of Charles II. ; The competitor (as a horse in a race) that is judged most likely to win; the competitor standing highest in the betting.	a:1hx0,34,6;ha1,24,3;1fju,0,1~1hx0,34,6;ha1,24,3;1fju,0,1	N:20z9,37,2~20z9,37,2
